OL,5,G0030 Through the Night
OL,6,     FJohannes Moser joins the Auckland
OL,7,     FPhilharmonia and conductor
OL,8,     FGiordano Bellincampi in
OL,9,     FTchaikovsky's Rococo Variations.
OL,10,     FThe orchestra also plays
OL,11,     FTchaikovsky's Capriccio Italien.
